    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own aquarium and collect fish. Swimming in a comfortable environment, the fish will bring you peace and happiness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can do other tasks or whatever you want. As time passes, the fish will begin to fill the sea. You can't stop the flowing waves. The fish may leave. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you found a new type of fish? Is there a fish with a special color? Is there a fish you want to put in your aquarium? If so, catch it. The fish will gladly enter your aquarium. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197730/extras/b34ff306a122289b06eedb8121f72dd3.poster.avif?t=1729706166\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197730/extras/b34ff306a122289b06eedb8121f72dd3.webm?t=1729706166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197730/extras/b34ff306a122289b06eedb8121f72dd3.mp4?t=1729706166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax. Listen to music and clear your mind. Enjoy watching your fish!</p>",
